ty":"bd81a5150e0dabb477bcdf6ebf70bdd1e8398dfda250a0917c48895c46e6dd32","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This small tree-shaped totem is imbued with powerful healing energies.","source_tag":"_t","target":"你能在这根小巧的树状图腾上感受到强大的治愈能量。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e424778be365e0143a4986da639ed0cb971dd5dc5855a225fc5c8abf5158babc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"14633081d645eaa465c5450445fbadac1a1bd87e1b770e6fc975ad3688248aae","logical_entry_identity":"cdf7a8ce27a945c03700a613f7eeb82a510b7448bde3765f8b63d42602757404","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Soul Pool","source_tag":"talent name","target":"灵魂槽"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"faaa62980ecf2a1bdb8012ef5611d0d6b6c4ad723d80147ed7a4237e10c15d8f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"146ca12264fd8503a498d65f516c559d607b2bc239dcebcc83b98b1620a3d9e9","logical_entry_identity":"9dd606246e0748eba0310b5f46ac3095604896bc7d020295e0c733de3b91e0a1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_RED##Target# is out of sight of its master; direct control will break!","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_RED##Target#在主人视野外；直接控制中断了！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1aeff526097a3721c71f5112cb5a5ff49d79e296ca814ad44db54af35793acd6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1470fbc1fc3a8823711c1ac7532356bcc52457ee0725a9881e8bbe3f8b75d2f2","logical_entry_identity":"4f268f862e908c0b70975c2dd4d99f4625887b20fb1b827058975ff172441ec0","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD#Linaniil concentrates her formidable will to restore her body!","source_tag":"saySimple","target":"#GOLD#莱娜尼尔集中了她强大的意志，复原了她的身体！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d157cf377f4800321f0f25c02b882f40d490e30b086a7e56572e64eee135777d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"147128f5a434f722d72cedb8f99b299c309b4659212df2fd49a0c03ffe7411ee","logical_entry_identity":"b0cd087a70adc195bd824022959c92865bfa7558caeed64b868d3218dc8859a4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"How may I be of service, good @playerdescriptor.race@?","source_tag":"_t","target":"我能为你提供什么服务？我亲爱的 @playerdescriptor.race@？"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"55c8d048577375321999f90e2530997611a63c4e225cc29fad0e5d0d3a91d43c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1472ec81b76250d8d28f0125a84066f7a269a2afe937edcb73a89c8d9297f792","logical_entry_identity":"f774579b301d1b3fcc39a6b07fc276a91df6afa7f4321908fbeca9f8186da96f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#{bold}#Sodelost, Dwarf Rogue#{normal}#\nCan't believe I agreed to this expedition. I suppose it's because I've known Relle for a while. We've crossed paths many times at Derth's trading post. I even gave her a special rate for my services. Sentimental fool! All it's got me is boots filled with snow and a light coinpurse. I still don't understand why these Kingdom types are so enamoured with drakeskin... makes superior armour they say. Pah! If you can't handle metal armour, what business do you have even wearing armour? Leather has about as much use as a halfling tied to a... noises up ahead, must stop writing.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#{bold}#矮人盗贼，苏达罗斯特#{normal}#\n真不敢相信我居然答应参加这次远征。大概是因为我和瑞丽相识已久吧。我们曾多次在德斯镇的贸易站碰面，我甚至还给她的雇佣费打了折。多愁善感的蠢货！结果只换来满靴子的雪和空瘪的钱袋。我还是不明白联合王国那些人为什么如此迷恋飞龙皮……他们说能制成上好的护甲。呸！连金属护甲都承受不了，还有什么资格穿护甲？皮革的用处就跟一个被绑在……前面有动静，得停笔了。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"45022265315a3782071e69700778e92e74ca5581010d95e6d2a6fea3a3b77acf","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"14855a62215608bd16e5d39c81a13005c63a07f8e7f59700632eaafbd03104a6","logical_entry_identity":"81bd19750392348d09fb378678f82f7fdb91ada4dcc6fd1cf9bf55948fac032c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This corpse was recently alive but moves as though it is just learning to use its body.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这具尸体刚刚被复活，它活动起来就像刚刚学会使用自己的身体一样。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"cf4b614c115ff017e12811d3194a9aa07f6a60dd320d44ef5a39c25066d58a9f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1486362430112a2f31267595d0556871f8cc14ad5dfd2f85e3ebb53e646960da","logical_entry_identity":"663a0796ca29564ebfdfa344a7d3c8efdea37e129f01569829cbfcf31c9bbc1b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Rimebark","source_tag":"talent name","target":"召唤：雾凇"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5850fab435216cbbebb4b3e27d35dd00d8c4ad24539bfc093e56460950b53469","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"148b8acfba1cbed5e104ad3cd11ee9649ee2690a11cceff391cfa544233375bd","logical_entry_identity":"511560ec394c48bdd3259d0b1e5d9cebcd922cffdb33ca9127c9393c674bfdc4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A swarm of midges; they want blood.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一群蚊子，它们渴望鲜血。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b1ff673553fe133bb8b0e10af495f5874cfba8b13d443b03523a1ace95e619a8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"14911fa8455a25c7c5e5039eb262759a6b40b02ca80579f07f33540dffc712b9","logical_entry_identity":"3f6b3e5cf33d6de79982811a939a0ccf8b28dfbf4df6f82cbafaabdf878c1533","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"snow giant thunderer","source_tag":"entity name","target":"闪电雪巨人"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"10a975f6e5803d61b5664095fcd4ebb174502c88aa27f6edd27fb035b2352a68","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1492e4cfb171bf1adbf2c991da9805e22bce3cc73551637a58f4ff2d58e178a7","logical_entry_identity":"08893191e2093d558d1ced3181a8a68bae2772b29320ae7996cf35a7494caa56","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"I have now devised the perfect trap for the horned beast that walks these halls! Truly he cannot avoid this amazing contraption - the perfect blend of technical mastery and nature's lethal gifts. Ah, how I look forward to having that monster's head mounted on my walls - it shall be the pride of my collection!\n\nThe contraption is elegant and simple, though many months I have spent getting the formula perfect. There are two vials attached together - one containing finely ground hemlock, the other containing a carefully prepared zinc compound. When the vials are broken the materials react with the air and pump out an amazing cloud of poisonous vapour! The poison is supremely effective, killing within minutes. All I have to do is carefully hide the vials beneath a thin piece of slate and wait for my prey to step upon the trap - then POOF, it's dead!\n\nI have prepared a great many vials to last me throughout the hunting season. By this time next year I will have a trophy collection to match the kings!\n\nI seem to have misplaced one though... I'm sure it must be close by.\n\n\nNo, NO! I have - I --- acci--- pain, such pa--______\n\n\n#{italic}#You find a dusty case filled with many small vials of powder. They seem serviceable.#{normal}#","source_tag":"_t","target":"我终于为那头在厅堂间出没的长角野兽设计出了完美陷阱！它绝不可能躲过这件惊人装置——这是精湛技艺与自然致命馈赠的完美结合。\n\n啊，我已经等不及要把那怪物的头挂上墙了——它必将成为我最得意的藏品！\n\n这装置精巧而简单，配方却耗费了我数月才臻于完美。两个小瓶连在一起：一瓶装着磨得极细的毒芹，另一瓶装着精心调制的锌化合物。瓶子一破，两种物质便与空气反应，喷出一大团剧毒气体！\n\n这个毒气陷阱效力绝佳，几分钟内便能置猎物于死地。我只需把小瓶藏在一片薄石板下，等猎物踩上去——砰，死定了！\n\n我备下了许多小瓶，足够用上整个狩猎季。到明年这个时候，我的战利品收藏就能与诸王的收藏相媲美了！\n\n不过有一瓶好像不见了……我敢肯定它就在附近。\n\n不，不！我——我——意---好痛，好---______\n\n#{italic}#你找到一只落满灰尘的匣子，里面装着许多盛有粉末的小瓶。它们似乎还能使用。#{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9cbed9d5c2aad22c3234cf7177a04977599a9ad87644a77cc70aef1059cb163f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"14951f29d5f4f99e97cab360180237c8f6681d1afc3bdf4d9fe7e0d00ab1c990","logical_entry_identity":"6c30590b084612ac5e0e263fab678b72dfca0d14647b7a045f21b0d3c8dd3312","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"jelly","source_tag":"entity subtype","target":"果冻怪"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f91495094b901e56852281203167f9925d82fc8455f60a9beadb56915e1e69d3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"14968ae5aa404b9ab4b0be46f19ad84dafa6166d954063f7abd16bf70a701deb","logical_entry_identity":"c4479534ba0fdda5e9c9964b2e6ac4a3de9ce04afab5c35b80535aeb61d99889","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You had to drop %s due to lack of space.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"由于空间不足，你必须丢下%s。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"af8e21226db77418c5b0f5098bbfe694d8775429bfb2410a0d7f2fc35b79040e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"14978666276df1480a74a57c3e25b4dd6d8b9d5afb0aeab664cdf32a7509c2e4","logical_entry_identity":"2a446cb017c59345a8dcdff6ae83bd4453dc0665ace4e18a980e169413d5e74a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Your target's doom draws near. Its healing factor is reduced by 80%%, and it will take %d%% of its remaining life (or %0.2f, whichever is lower) over 10 turns as frostdusk damage.\n\t\tThis spell is so powerful that every 3 turns it tears a part of the target's soul, generating one soul for you.\n\t\tThe damage will increase with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你使目标厄运临头。10回合内，目标的治疗加成减少 80%%，并累计受到 %d%% 剩余生命值（至多 %0.2f 点）霜暮伤害。\n\t\t这个法术的力量是如此强大，每 3 回合它会撕裂目标灵魂的一部分，使你获得一个灵魂。\n\t\t伤害受法术强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2522f1df42b108d552e15e65bc25bf8af06bd908dece69d21f1b6324b8b3e32e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1498de874ccf8c8fc89389132053fad92c46dfe0d8f2c64de03f0776634b5354","logical_entry_identity":"af2d08d0edddb4f39858fc5aca0af2b53d3bcc3ab6efc17a9716cd26998e0201","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"ceremonial staff","source_tag":"_t","target":"礼仪用的法杖"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c7919bc996c2eab89e314020b83f5c9a7d9e73e085cf8a02b799cc6b9c5ed720","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1499f9f203847ea056c987246cb526bbb0213c5f092828b26f8ed04de5db826e","logical_entry_identity":"50ac43634f44d2693e31bb900ca28c80315ef9e065351ec362224dbeb5329b46","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The Way sent me to explore this side of the tunnel.","source_tag":"_t","target":"维网派我来探索隧道这一侧。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"531af9e66e47ba0319c1befb5ffb0326130413e291663eb422b11e3adf286364","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"149ee315a688d72b528a4cb09a7ce76874f2dad354470878c2192d2f8f60bdb2","logical_entry_identity":"c566a1e0a8bffc6a5e457b97e32962ba21a9707be8ad3d076a0ceb51d12396ab","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"naga myrmido