6d56e4b7f83644a23765c458afc359e1823e","logical_entry_identity":"72dd9a7c9b18aa8eccb7b4e159cf6e3319d792d9e0dc8d78fabead1e1cc9d11e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"volcanic","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"火山"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6e25ea0d55f3cbc1ae953d0638ce20f830a05b44282610f65c1f2e8a41787983","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"14d9c10378ceb1eeeff3fc96fadc346c06abb397f2df2e7d3b5d2a2a232727ed","logical_entry_identity":"1dfdddcbab5639b2316e581883d82d831abd63c9ef49bb66adac858f46928b7d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This gore-stained battleaxe was once used by an infamously sadistic king, who took the time to personally perform each and every execution he ordered. He kept a vault of every head he ever removed, each and every one of them carefully preserved. When he was overthrown, his own head was added as the centrepiece of the vault, which was maintained as a testament to his cruelty.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这把沾满血迹的战斧曾被一位臭名昭著的残忍国王使用，他下令执行的每一场处决都会亲自操刀。他把砍下的每一颗头颅都保存在一间密室中，每一颗都被仔细防腐处理。当他被推翻后，他自己的头颅也被加入其中，成为那间密室的中心展品，密室则被保留下来，作为他残忍暴行的见证。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e85c47398c28e537579047ffe7fa4dd10fe3c76b84b7ca00b830b2101c3a6a6e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"14dacd61c71035ca63e5d87b34eaa215b9770bbcb2aa1af17539ffca93021a21","logical_entry_identity":"7bdf10a59476bd6a6dbda66db14675c66ce5726038c0438b3f194533890fbc97","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"When a single blow deals more than 15%% of your total life, a torrent of blood gushes from your body, creating a bloody tidal wave for 4 turns that deals %0.2f blight damage, heals you for 50%% of the damage done, and knocks foes back.\n\t\tThe damage increases with your Constitution.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"当敌人的单次攻击造成超过你 15%% 总生命值伤害时，产生持续 4 回合的血之狂潮，造成 %0.2f 枯萎伤害并治疗你相当于 50%% 伤害值的生命，同时击退敌人。\n\t\t伤害受体质值加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e97a7ff0d2312c53591052f57f20f7579c39f703d125f7219f993d6323711541","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"14e06df710f2ea192cdd9884e601d9879c5b251bedde67fb2061c700738b2dbe","logical_entry_identity":"a3cbe2e7f5a2159964fceb234547b53180c69a2cf963488a48c3d8e36ddfa0db","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"a summoned wall of ice","source_tag":"_t","target":"被召唤的冰墙"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"defddd6358884e41819d215ce6eb077fa09e680f6dde593dfc9c6ad46f37eb75","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"14ea6fd2616220d70d244673fcfd298533f4ac3772760a9125ec4b1617d94168","logical_entry_identity":"8045d68bb0d6ee315f02c8e94146c9ad222f068a1a66b4357bf37136690e93da","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Light radius: ","source_tag":"_t","target":"光照范围："},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7a36cdad455093d5ba60a60f8daa977d0e83096f22074155482197d10e1817a1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"14eae41eb143ff4d97b10c9b0cd46153edfa5991bf0173c7adfd6c3f02fc06bd","logical_entry_identity":"5e5e943dcafa5dbe785c83874aaa051315c8c0b146829c122854b49c52661938","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#{bold}#\nFoursaw the Clown\n#{normal}#82 - 114#{italic}#\nWe laughed\nUntil we saw\nThe joke was over\n#{normal}#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#{bold}#\n小丑福萨\n#{normal}#82 - 114#{italic}#\n我们笑了，直到发现——笑话已经结束\n#{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9ecf2e7aa6ec0f0af2d3fc14b2db2eab9feb90ffe1c74c91efcef69fb0af7565","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"14ebbd35878e9e962cbd6b7d44944d44afcca91968af4ed993f61a2acf21ae6f","logical_entry_identity":"c5de31ea6297f8b29e978eb0e4473d1d14d817181b49dd095ea72c928c0a2dd1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The pounding forge of thought in your mind is released upon your surroundings.  Each turn that you remain stationary, you'll strike the dreamforge, inflicting mind and burning damage on enemies around you.\n\t\tThe effect will build over five turns, until it reaches a maximum radius of %d, maximum mind damage of %0.2f, and maximum burning damage of %0.2f.\n\t\tAt this point you'll begin breaking the dreams of enemies who hear the forge, reducing their Mental Save by %d and giving them a %d%% chance of spell failure due to the tremendous echo in their minds for %d turns.\n\t\tBroken Dreams has a %d%% chance to brainlock your enemies.\n\t\tThe damage and dream breaking effect will scale with your Mindpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你将脑海里锻造的冲击波向四周释放。\n\t\t每回合当你保持静止，你将会锤击梦之熔炉，对周围敌人造成精神和燃烧伤害。\n\t\t此效果将递增 5 个回合，直至 %d 码最大范围，%0.2f 最大精神伤害和 %0.2f 最大燃烧伤害。\n\t\t此刻，你将会打破那些听到熔炉声的敌人梦境，减少它们 %d 精神豁免，并且由于敲击熔炉的\n\t\t巨大回声，它们将获得一个 %d%% 的法术失败率，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t梦境破碎有 %d%% 几率对你的敌人产生思维封锁效果。\n\t\t受精神强度影响，伤害和梦境打破效果按比例加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6365c1bf3646d9a274687f4c83293e02f92d7963a8115957c55e479a3fe39a16","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"14ef77e2cf1d768f985baa3adaa0f9ed7996611a135f931544f3461361e2b632","logical_entry_identity":"c091f5941a2f1e598340e25ca7a3329f61e0077d510efaee6a1786a9eb3b7f64","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*The halfling hands you a note that says, 'Heard %s managed to make a %s while you've been loafing. Hurry the hell up next time.*#WHITE#\n\t\tI STILL CAN'T HEAR A DAMNED THING. FORTUNATELY, YOU DON'T LOOK LIKE THE SORT THAT MAKES INTERESTING CONVERSATION.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*那个半身人递给你一张纸条，上面写着：听说 %s 在你离开的时候制造了 %s。下次动作快点。*#WHITE#\n\t\t我还是什么都听不见，幸运的是，看上去似乎和你聊天也没什么意思。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"55d6eed1c3faf407ae8cff9fac201c800a11e65fb9ea001b298dd09cc8e1d359","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"14ef93c005d9641b3c2ca8a6ed7d86d95eb6a8d3d787cfba5a3703d6bb8f3265","logical_entry_identity":"584050b8e54eb2d7e9f73711461a928173d8d29f7afbafe294db82d26c22c095","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Yes, thank you.","source_tag":"_t","target":"是的，谢谢你。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"aa7677bdb03fc699823d3e80f7b209831524333b952d4073b5dc0e0ca55dd324","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1500edaaab9312e3c97a10132976944b8f49bb6f6fa0aab3eb146b4e88dc2a59"